# ---- Environment ----
# .env is committed on purpose for this class project. Normally a secrets
# file like this would stay out of the repo, but everyone on the team (and
# whoever grades this) needs the same working MySQL connection to run the
# site with no extra setup, and the assignment itself assigns one shared
# database name/username/password for the whole team - there's no real
# secret here to protect. Don't copy this pattern into a non-classroom repo.
# .env

